<title>SINGAPORE: Asian rice prices - February 6.</title>
<headline>Asian rice prices - February 6.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted by trading and official sources in the key producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam and India in U.S. dollars a tonne:</p>
<p>								 Feb 6    Jan 30</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok  370-390  370-395</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok	620-630  620-630</p>
<p>India-5.0 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain) FOB  290	290</p>
<p>India-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	   280	280</p>
<p>India-15 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	   245	245</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	   230	230</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port	270-275  270-273</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	   262	262</p>
</text>
